Here, |garbage⊥ ⟩ is a state orthogonal to |0⟩⊗na ⊗ H/α |Ω⟩. Due to the normalization, the probability
of getting |0⟩⊗na is given by psucc = ∥H |Ω⟩ ∥2 /α2 . By extending Eq. (36) to controlled-unitary
